  "whyPlay": "Factorio is the closest thing to a digital drug. You start by hand-mining iron ore. 200 hours later, you're debugging a 12-lane train network while calculating throughput ratios for your nuclear reactor. The Space Age DLC doubled the game length by adding four new planets, each with entirely new production challenges. There's a reason it's one of the highest-rated games in Steam history — it's perfect.",
  "whyPlayZh": "《异星工厂》是最接近数字毒品的东西。你从手挖铁矿开始，200 小时后你在调试 12 轨火车网络，同时计算核电输出比。太空时代 DLC 加了四个新星球，每个都有全新的生产挑战，游戏长度直接翻倍。它是 Steam 历史评分最高的游戏之一——因为它完美。"
